''               15 Sep 2026 -- SRC_REV=11, FMT 3: OVERSHT ends with the fault-API trial (task 3552), so
''               task 3547's fault reporting can be certified unattended -- BM-OUT runs only in the
''               ATTENDED OUTSIDE segment today, and the steering object's isFaulted() / isEmergency() can
''               only be read while that object runs. It is LAST in the segment because a provoked fault
''               resets tracking and would contaminate C-3. New record BM-FLTAPI and new cell
''               R14-DUAL-FLTAPI-B; no existing record changes shape, but the record set gains one, so
''               FMT goes to 3 the way appended fields took it to 2
''               16 Sep 2026 -- SRC_REV=12: the attended panel rebuilt per the PL-64 audit
''               (DOCs/analyses/ATTENDED-UI-AUDIT-2026-09-15.md sec 6). Every attended screen is a row of the
