''               18 Sep 2026 -- SRC_REV=18: task 3517, style guide 5.4.1 -- every method returning one
''               boolean is named is/has/b (bInstArm(), bWheelStart(), isWheelUp(), ...). No record changes.
''               18 Sep 2026 -- SRC_REV=19: task 3543 (PL-41, PL-85). Every cog start or stop -- wheel and
