''               38's jerk-limited ramp and 39's stop plan (PL-160, PL-161), each bound re-derived from the S-curve's own
''               passes and travel at the built-in rates. MOVED: the quarter's (BRISK) steady window, 500 -> 300 ms
''               (spinWinMs): its spin-up now runs 40.1 ticks and its stop 31.2 (were 31 and 19), so the limit fires at
''               ~178.8 of 211 and a 500 ms window would end ~90 ms after it, reading A-8, the path scale and the pair on
