''               Rev A guard that did trip. The library's guard fires on a net reading at or above that value and logs
''               that reading, so the bound is the guard's own. No record changes shape; FMT stays 38. And DRIVER_REV
''               40's unbiased current (getCurrent() adds the reading's half count, the rest zero is the offset
''               rounded, the winding net mean floor + 1 and its trip r >= limit): every bound on getCurrent(),
