''               30 Sep 2026 -- SRC_REV=70, FMT 44: the seven harness defects the first floor visit found
''               (DOCs/analyses/bench/2026-09-30/floor/FLOOR-VISIT-EVALUATION.md sec 7, H1-H7); no driver or library change.
''               H1: bSpinStopBegun() took a wheel's DCS_SPIN_DN for "the distance stop has fired", but the driver reads
''               SPIN_DN whenever |v| >= |target| and the floor's path limiter lowers a running target, so the settle and the
''               steady window were cut on every schedule spin and on FAULTRUN; the stop has begun when a wheel's TARGET is
