''               gains o_e, o_st and o_flt, the other wheel's lag, state and fault flag from the same ring sample (308 bytes
''               worst case). H3: LDHUNT (criterion PATH_FLIPS_IN_WIN, bound 0) counts the path limiter's
''               TRANSITIONS, engages and releases, inside the judged window -- the cycling PL-144 is about -- and is NOMEAS
''               unless the limiter is engaged over it; BM-LOADW replaces engages with flips and gains engages_pre (the
''               start-up's, printed, not judged) and engaged; the RESULT line says a hold too firm to judge the line, a
