  '                 check of every straight leg against the 2 m square; and the sessions' own additions to the shared legs (the
  '                 event drain after a spin leg, the fence checks in FAULTRUN's three drives): the SPIN sessions only,
  '                 FLOOR_ACT_AUTO and FLOOR_ACT_OBSTACLE. The fourteen single actions compile none of it
#ifdef DBF_AUTO
